From 4b953cc78c95e04cd9a7a2cb0b17e6f680d67a00 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ewoog <Ewoog@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 21:50:47 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] Allow the addon to learn professions and to invite grouped
 bots

GETPROFS/SETPROF let a grouped commander teach or wipe a bot profession.
CoA does not cap primary professions, so any catalog skill can be learned.
Starting skill defaults to the level cap (CoaBots.Prof.StartSkill = 0).

Inviting a bot that is already in another group makes it leave and join,
unless it is in combat, a battleground, or a dungeon/raid instance. This
covers /invite, INVITEBOT, Quick Fill, and .botcmd invitebot.
---
